+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+A client MAY request conversation summaries over the authenticated socket. The server answers with summaries belonging only to the connection's authenticated user; the request frame does not select a user, and summaries contain metadata rather than conversation content. ([validated by: answers an authenticated user with their own summaries and no conversation content](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L8))
